                "footer": {
                    "_type": "Diesel Product Footer",
                    "copy": "© and published 2014 by Plaion GmbH. Deep Silver is a division of Plaion GmbH. Developed by 4A Games. 4A Games Limited and their respective logo are trademarks of 4A Games Limited. “Metro 2033 Redux”, “Metro: Last Light Redux”, “Metro Redux” are inspired by the novels “Metro 2033” and “Metro 2035” by Dmitry Glukhovsky. All other trademarks, logos and copyrights are property of their respective owners.",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
